nd:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">你明媚地洒下了波纹</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">我便抬起头看向月亮</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">想要抱紧了你的星星</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">做一个吟唱夜的伶人</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">\n</span></p><p><span style=\"background:;color:;\">按：一年前所作。不必多言了。</span></p>",
